  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Right now on the open beta, the upper limit of FOV is `75` but I think it'd be better to cap it off at `90` or even `110`. Understandably, there are concerns over the fish-eye effect, but overall I wouldn't consider it very detrimental to many who would prefer higher FOV.",
